  "bio": "Milena Correia Mileink, a London-based tattoo artist, specializes in striking black and gray designs that showcase her exceptional skill level. Her work, which can be seen at 2nd Skin London, is characterized by precise detailing and shading, ensuring each piece is a standout work of art. Clients laud Milena for her dedication to professionalism, which is evident in both her artistic process and the stunning results.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
